  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿媽ê番麥"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>王怡方</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮阿媽蹛tī屏東庄跤，透早天拍phú仔光，伊就起床款早頓，了後騎鐵馬去田--裡種作。阿媽ê田有tsiok濟寶貝——竹筍、塗豆、楊桃hām番麥，一年四季照輪收成，阿媽tiānn-tiānn講伊家己無讀啥mih冊，所以只好來作田，看天食穿。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">以早生活tsiânn艱苦，社會koh重男輕女，阮阿母kan-na生兩个查某，阿媽真煩惱，驚阮三个母囝無人疼惜，sù常kā阮阿母講：「M̄免煩惱，你iáu有後頭厝，阿娘iáu-koh tī--leh！」Ē記得細漢ê時，阮姊妹仔上愛tuè阿母tńg去阿媽in兜，阿媽看著阮，永遠lóng是微微仔笑，而且koh khe̍h出早就sa̍h好ê番麥，番麥搵鹽是上簡單ê料理，也是上平凡ê幸福。「你beh tuè我去菜市仔se̍h-se̍h--leh--無？順suà賣番麥！」「好--啊」我隨應。阿媽牽鐵馬，鐵馬後壁載一个pua̍h桶，內底囥一枝一枝sa̍h好ê番麥，伊叫我正手khiú伊ê衫仔裾，伊kā鐵馬牽--leh，阮一步一步ná唱歌ná行去黃昏市場。來到鬧熱滾滾ê市場，阿媽大聲hiàm，siânn人來買：「番麥！番麥！好食ê番麥，無甜免錢--ooh！」因為阿媽家己種番麥，koh無噴農藥仔，所以lóng有老主顧ē kā伊phâng場，無偌久番麥就賣完。阿媽tsit-tsūn就ē kā我抱--起-來，hōo我坐tī鐵馬頂kuân，伊仝款kā鐵馬牽--leh，唱歌hōo我聽，身邊草埔仔有m̄知影名ê蟲仔傳出「tsi！tsi！」ê聲，tsiânn做阮ê伴奏。Tsit條tńg--去ê路，mā是我上懷念ê路。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管日頭赤iānn-iānn iah是落大雨，阿媽lóng無閒tshih-tshih，拚勢趁錢，iáu-koh leh讀冊ê阮，逐擺tńg去阿媽in兜，阿媽就ē趕緊去房間，uì衫櫥內底khe̍h出早就準備好勢ê紅包hōo--阮，原來是伊操煩——tī tsit个大環境內底，查某囝khah bē得人疼，驚阮日子歹過，所以偷偷仔將賣番麥趁ê sai-khia錢lóng hōo--阮，koh交代--阮：「Ài好好仔讀冊，做一个好人--őo！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「番麥！番麥！好食ê番麥，無甜免錢--ooh！」認真hiàm ê聲音koh tī耳空邊tńg-se̍h，微微仔笑容hām目睭親像koh tī面頭前，時間thài ē tsiah-nī緊，阿媽過身十外年--ah，進前生活環境無好，想著伊賣番麥，瘦koh薄板ê身軀，是按怎十箍十箍kā sai-khia錢儉--起-來？為著阮序細，扛起一phiàn天。人講「爸母疼囝長流水」、「惜花連盆，惜囝連孫」，想到tsia，我ê目箍早就已經紅kì-kì，阿媽ê用心，我ē永遠囥tī心肝底；阿媽交代ê話，我ē記tiâu-tiâu，bē tuè時間流失。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgcaEfuwooA-1WXZ78cBf2FLTBCjxBeG-jr4HLRW_SHCZ8w9V49rBk3gy8tCRQqJLFH7_j-n7_E_zkwIIJt6yYQjy07qiQkpZ4EkEt45Zomlo7SLUhJxrOPGTN54J11wHDot3qnHB9We814s98cWbf8YKyNOESyunROolsuGuAZ5vz8OQ6j8aOBf1-YPPMv/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_18_b.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgcaEfuwooA-1WXZ78cBf2FLTBCjxBeG-jr4HLRW_SHCZ8w9V49rBk3gy8tCRQqJLFH7_j-n7_E_zkwIIJt6yYQjy07qiQkpZ4EkEt45Zomlo7SLUhJxrOPGTN54J11wHDot3qnHB9We814s98cWbf8YKyNOESyunROolsuGuAZ5vz8OQ6j8aOBf1-YPPMv/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_18_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZPSl9vnc5KFsyJkngQTOmVfqIUtkawnkyzn3uja5nwptof1h_6CPDNLTr1rI1rlJlUodIrGBYRh1IwT8Hr7GPbU2vW20xO0aXOs38E88HVbNmlKpLhF73zUaIsfGgg8HESJFKz4vlbNvJmFmiHO3cdA-qOySIFF0X5RCwQT2WOH488F31Bi66AhcZFZLh/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZPSl9vnc5KFsyJkngQTOmVfqIUtkawnkyzn3uja5nwptof1h_6CPDNLTr1rI1rlJlUodIrGBYRh1IwT8Hr7GPbU2vW20xO0aXOs38E88HVbNmlKpLhF73zUaIsfGgg8HESJFKz4vlbNvJmFmiHO3cdA-qOySIFF0X5RCwQT2WOH488F31Bi66AhcZFZLh/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/s1424/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"font-size: medium; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/w450-h640/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#台灣人寫真 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\n<br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8n